+#### `createBackup`
+
+*   Creates a backup of the current collection in the user's configured backup folder, blocking until the backup completes. Equivalent to triggering the desktop UI's *Tools → Create Backup* menu item. The `force=True` semantics of `Collection.create_backup` are used, so the user's configured backup interval is bypassed; rotation of older backups still follows the user's *Daily / Weekly / Monthly backups to keep* preferences.
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample request:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "action": "createBackup",
+        "version": 6
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample result:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "result": null,
+        "error": null
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
 #### `sync`
 
 *   Synchronizes the local Anki collections with AnkiWeb.
